{"seq":2,"slug":"churn-score-segment","title":"流失评分与人群分层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-retention-repurchase/churn-prediction/churn-score-segment","wordCount":1815,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"流失评分与人群分层\">流失评分与人群分层</h1><p>模型产出的是一列 0 到 1 之间的浮点数，运营需要的是「今天给这 5000 个人发消息」。这中间隔着一层必须显式设计的转换——<strong>分层</strong>。分层看起来只是切几个阈值，但它的每一个设计选择都会直接决定预算花在哪、以及运营能不能理解系统给出的队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-概率不是动作-分层才是\">核心概念：概率不是动作，分层才是</h2><p>一条最朴素的分层是「概率 &gt; 0.7 高危、0.4–0.7 中危、&lt; 0.4 低危」。它在演示里工作良好，在真实系统里会暴露三个问题。</p>\n<p><strong>问题一：阈值与预算脱节。</strong> 高危人群可能有 12 万人，而本周的触达预算只够 2 万条。阈值定死了，运营就只能在前 2 万里随机挑，或者干脆超额发送导致频控被打破。</p>\n<p><strong>问题二：分层丢了排序。</strong> 同为「高危」，0.71 与 0.99 的干预价值完全不同。分层把连续的排序压成几档，档内无法再优化。</p>\n<p><strong>问题三：概率高 ≠ 该干预。</strong> 这一条最致命，第一章第 3 篇会展开，这里先记住结论：高流失概率的人里混着大量「你干预也没用」的人，按概率排序会把预算优先给到最无效的干预。</p>\n<p>正确的分工是：<strong>模型给排序，分层给沟通语言，预算约束给截断点</strong>。三者分开设计，各自演进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流失概率模型] --&gt; B[按干预价值重排序]&#10;    C[本周触达预算] --&gt; D[确定截断点 K]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[Top-K 干预队列]&#10;    B --&gt; F[按概率分档]&#10;    F --&gt; G{人群分层标签}&#10;    G --&gt; H[运营沟通 / 文案选择]&#10;    E --&gt; I[触达执行]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[流失概率模型] --&gt; B[按干预价值重排序]\n    C[本周触达预算] --&gt; D[确定截断点 K]\n    B --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[Top-K 干预队列]\n    B --&gt; F[按概率分档]\n    F --&gt; G{人群分层标签}\n    G --&gt; H[运营沟通 / 文案选择]\n    E --&gt; I[触达执行]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层目的</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>变化频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>干预队列</td>\n<td>干预价值分</td>\n<td>有序用户列表</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算分配</td>\n<td>队列长度 + 单位成本</td>\n<td>截断点 K</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营沟通</td>\n<td>概率档 + 用户语言</td>\n<td>分层标签</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略分析</td>\n<td>分层历史</td>\n<td>cohort 对比</td>\n<td>每季</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按干预价值重排序\">按干预价值重排序</h2><p>如果已经做了 Uplift 建模（第一章第 3 篇），排序键直接用增量增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。如果没有，一个实用的折中是<strong>期望挽留价值</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>margin</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}(x) = p_{\\text{churn}}(x) \\cdot \\text{margin}(x) \\cdot r(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{churn}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是流失概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>margin</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{margin}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">margin</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户的预期毛利（客单价 × 毛利率 × 预期复购次数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该用户对触达的<strong>可达概率</strong>——它同时包含通道可达性（是否关闭了推送、邮箱是否有效）与触达合规性（是否有同意、是否在免打扰期）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(x) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的用户无论概率多高都不该进队列。</p>\n<p>这个公式的价值不在精确，而在于它逼团队把三个常被忽略的因素显式化：用户价值（不是所有人等值）、可达性（发不到就是白花）、以及毛利而非 GMV（高 GMV 低毛利的用户不值得高成本挽留）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层标签的设计\">分层标签的设计</h3><p>面向运营的分层标签应该描述<strong>用户状态</strong>而不是概率数值。运营能理解「刚取消订阅的会员」，理解不了「p=0.73」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分层标签</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>建议动作</th>\n<th>不应做</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主动声明离开</td>\n<td>取消订阅/关闭推送</td>\n<td>一对一服务补救</td>\n<td>群发优惠券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节奏偏离</td>\n<td>距上次下单 &gt; 1.5×个人间隔</td>\n<td>补货提醒</td>\n<td>高价挽留券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沉默流失</td>\n<td>90 天无活跃且无权益变更</td>\n<td>低成本的唤醒触达</td>\n<td>大额补贴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值流失</td>\n<td>高毛利用户 + 中度概率</td>\n<td>专属权益 + 客服</td>\n<td>通用券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格流失</td>\n<td>仅促销期下单 + 当前无促销</td>\n<td>等待促销节点</td>\n<td>常态高价触达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务受损</td>\n<td>近期退货/差评/工单升级</td>\n<td>服务补救优先</td>\n<td>营销信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的最后一列是刻意设计的：<strong>每个分层都要定义「不该做什么」</strong>。系统里最常见的浪费不是没发消息，而是把错误的动作发给了错误的人群——给刚投诉过的用户发促销是最典型的自毁行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层的验证与稳定性\">分层的验证与稳定性</h2><p>分层上线后必须能被验证，否则它会慢慢漂移成一个没人敢动的黑箱。三个可用的检查。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，单调性检查。</strong> 分层的平均实际流失率应该随风险等级单调上升。如果「高危」层的实际流失率低于「中危」，说明分层逻辑或模型出了问题。这个检查应该按周自动跑，它是最便宜的健康度指标。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，分布稳定性。</strong> 每一层的人数占比会随季节、促销、市场扩张而漂移。设定预期的占比区间（如高危层应占 8%–15%），超出即告警——最常见的异常是模型输入的特征分布因为上游埋点变更而整体偏移（特征漂移），此时所有分层都会失真。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，结果稳定性。</strong> 同一批用户在连续两天的分层结果不应剧烈跳变。如果昨天高危今天安全，多半是模型对某个高波动特征过度敏感（比如昨天的短期活跃计数）。修正方式是对分数做时间平滑（指数移动平均），代价是响应变慢——所以平滑系数需要在「稳定」与「及时」之间显式权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[每日评分] --&gt; B[单调性检查]&#10;    B --&gt; C{高危层流失率 &gt; 中危层?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[告警: 分层失效]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[占比区间检查]&#10;    E --&gt; F{各层占比在预期区间?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[告警: 特征漂移嫌疑]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[跳变检查]&#10;    H --&gt; I{单用户分数日间跳变 &gt; 0.3?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[分数时间平滑]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[分层发布]&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[每日评分] --&gt; B[单调性检查]\n    B --&gt; C{高危层流失率 &gt; 中危层?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[告警: 分层失效]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[占比区间检查]\n    E --&gt; F{各层占比在预期区间?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[告警: 特征漂移嫌疑]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[跳变检查]\n    H --&gt; I{单用户分数日间跳变 &gt; 0.3?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[分数时间平滑]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[分层发布]\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"从分层到干预队列\">从分层到干预队列</h2><p>最后一步是把分层与预算合成一条可执行队列。做法是按干预价值降序，逐条消耗预算直到用完：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ScoredUser {&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  churnProb: number;&#10;  expectedValue: number;&#10;  reachability: number;&#10;  segment: SegmentLabel;&#10;  language: string;&#10;  timezone: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface InterventionQueueItem {&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  rank: number;&#10;  segment: SegmentLabel;&#10;  action: ActionType;&#10;  estimatedCost: number;&#10;  estimatedSaveValue: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildQueue(users: ScoredUser[], budget: number): InterventionQueueItem[] {&#10;  const eligible = users.filter((u) =&gt; u.reachability &gt; 0.05);&#10;  const ranked = eligible.sort((a, b) =&gt; b.expectedValue * b.reachability - a.expectedValue * a.reachability);&#10;  const queue: InterventionQueueItem[] = [];&#10;  let spent = 0;&#10;  for (const u of ranked) {&#10;    const action = pickAction(u.segment, u.churnProb);&#10;    const cost = actionCost(action, u.language);&#10;    if (spent + cost &gt; budget) continue;&#10;    spent += cost;&#10;    queue.push({&#10;      userId: u.userId,&#10;      rank: queue.length + 1,&#10;      segment: u.segment,&#10;      action,&#10;      estimatedCost: cost,&#10;      estimatedSaveValue: u.expectedValue * u.reachability,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;  return queue;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScoredUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  churnProb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expectedValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reachability</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  segment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SegmentLabel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  language</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timezone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InterventionQueueItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span